 MITSUNORI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOSHIDA YUKUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AZUMA, MITSUYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>UEHATA, MASAYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>WAKI, MITSUNORI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIDA, YUKUO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Preventives/remedies for glaucoma containing compounds having an Rho kinase inhibitory activity, in particular, those represented by general formula (I), wherein each symbol is as defined in the specification. These preventives/remedies are novel ones having effects of lowering ocular tension, ameliorating optic papilla blood flow and promoting humor aqueous outflow.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne des médicaments préventifs/curatifs pour le glaucome, qui contiennent des composés présentant une activité inhibitrice de la Rho kinase, en particulier ceux représentés par la formule générale (I), formule dans laquelle chaque symbole correspond à la définition donnée dans la description. Ces médicaments préventifs/curatifs sont de nouveaux médicaments qui ont pour effets d'abaisser la pression intraoculaire, d'améliorer le flux sanguin dans la papille optique et de favoriser l'écoulement de l'humeur aqueuse.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws